DEFENSIVE-USE STATEMENT:

KMTO is intended for legitimate defensive security research, education, and
mitigation assurance work — verifying that hardware-assisted kernel
mitigations (SMEP, SMAP, PAC, CFG, KASLR, KPTI) behave as designed in a
given system configuration. The framework performs observation and
telemetry only; it does not contain exploitation, privilege-escalation, or
control-flow-hijack code paths. Users are responsible for ensuring their
use complies with all applicable laws and institutional policies.
